        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Detroit, Kids in Love\n- People: Kathryn Bigelow, Mark Boal, Will Poulter, Alma Jodorowsky, Jamie Blackley, Sebastian de Souza, Preston Thompson, Cara Delevingne, Gala Gordon\n- Events: Algiers Motel incident, 1967 Detroit riot, 12th Street riot, Long Hot Summer of 1967\n- Topics: American period crime drama films, race riots in the United States\n\nFacts:\n- The 1967 Detroit riot, also known as the 12th Street riot or the 1967 Detroit rebellion, was one of 159 race riots that occurred in United States cities during the Long Hot Summer of 1967.\n- Will Poulter was born on 28 January 1993 and is an English actor.\n- Will Poulter is known for work in the films Son of Rambow, The Chronicles of Narnia: The Voyage of the Dawn Treader, We're the Millers, The Maze Runner, The Revenant, and Detroit.\n- Detroit is a 2017 American period crime drama film directed by Kathryn Bigelow and written by Mark Boal.\n- Detroit is based on the Algiers Motel incident during Detroit's 1967 12th Street Riot, and its release commemorated the event's 50th anniversary.\n- Kids in Love stars Will Poulter, Alma Jodorowsky, Jamie Blackley, Sebastian de Souza, Preston Thompson, Cara Delevingne, and Gala Gordon.",
